---
// PropuestaValor.astro — Platform-first value prop framing
---
<section id="propuesta" class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="text-center mb-16" data-animate>
            <p class="text-xs font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-3">Diferenciadores</p>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-plai-dark mb-4">¿Por qué PLAI?</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 font-body max-w-2xl mx-auto">Software propio, backoffice incluido y resultados medibles desde el primer mes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto" data-animate data-animate-stagger>

            <div class="flex gap-5 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all duration-300 group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-plai-primary/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-plai-primary/20 transition-colors duration-300">
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" class="w-6 h-6 text-plai-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 21h16.5M4.5 3h15M5.25 3v18m13.5-18v18M9 6.75h1.5m-1.5 3h1.5m-1.5 3h1.5m3-6H15m-1.5 3H15m-1.5 3H15M9 21v-3.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h3.75c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-plai-dark font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2">Plataforma, no agencia</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 font-body leading-relaxed">Tu equipo opera el software desde su propio panel. Sin intermediarios, sin dependencia operativa. Control total sobre lo que la plataforma ejecuta.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-5 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all duration-300 group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-plai-cyan/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-plai-cyan/20 transition-colors duration-300">
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" class="w-6 h-6 text-plai-cyan" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 17.25v1.007a3 3 0 01-.879 2.122L7.5 21h9l-.621-.621A3 3 0 0115 18.257V17.25m6-12V15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 15V5.25m18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0018.75 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 5.25m18 0H3"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-plai-dark font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2">Backoffice propio con IA</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 font-body leading-relaxed">Dashboard en tiempo real para monitorear conversiones, contenido y el agente IA. Visibilidad completa sobre cada acción que genera resultado.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-5 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all duration-300 group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-plai-magenta/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-plai-magenta/20 transition-colors duration-300">
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" class="w-6 h-6 text-plai-magenta" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-plai-dark font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2">Ingresos activos 24/7</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 font-body leading-relaxed">ERI atiende, vende y recupera carritos mientras duermes. GEMA publica contenido de forma autónoma. Tu negocio genera mientras no estás.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-5 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all duration-300 group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-plai-accent/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-plai-accent/20 transition-colors duration-300">
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" class="w-6 h-6 text-plai-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 14.25l6-6m4.5-3.493V21.75l-3.75-1.5-3.75 1.5-3.75-1.5-3.75 1.5V4.757c0-1.108.806-2.057 1.907-2.185a48.507 48.507 0 0111.186 0c1.1.128 1.907 1.077 1.907 2.185z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-plai-dark font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2">Precio fijo, costo predecible</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 font-body leading-relaxed">Suscripción mensual clara, sin cotizaciones ni sorpresas. Hasta 3× más económico que una agencia externa, con mayor retorno medible.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
